@startuml
' Business-state contract: compilation/start/completion gates; PR-SMR-006..008, PR-SMR-020
[*] --> UNCOMPILED
UNCOMPILED --> COMPILING : compile requested
COMPILING --> READY : startable model produced
COMPILING --> BLOCKED : automatic correction cannot produce startable model
BLOCKED --> COMPILING : source / Primary / prompt / creativity changed; retry
READY --> COMPILING : pre-start inputs changed; recompile
READY --> RUNNING : Adventure Start / lock current model
RUNNING --> COMPLETED : resolution condition satisfied + concluding Scene committed
COMPLETED --> [*]
note right of RUNNING
No Scenario Model recompilation or replacement
within this adventure.
Runtime continuity uses RAG and Runtime-added Facts.
end note
@enduml
